<title>FINLAND: ASKO TO SELL FORSSA SAW MILL TO VAPO.</title>
<headline>ASKO TO SELL FORSSA SAW MILL TO VAPO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish furniture and plastic pipe maker Asko Oy said on Wednesday it had signed a letter of intent to sell its Forssan Saha saw mill to state-owned peat and sawn goods group Vapo Oy for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale of Forssan Saha is part of strategy, according to which Asko group will focus on its core businesses,&quot; Asko said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Asko estimated Forssan Saha's 1996 net sales to be about 42 million markka and its output about 43,000 cubic metres and said the unit has 47 employees.</p>
<p>The deal was due to be completed by the end of 1996, Asko said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
